        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.47.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.47.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EZK.45.8"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Ezk 45:8",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Uku ni k’Umwami Uhoraho agize, at’ Uru ni rwo rugabano muzogabanirakw igihugu, ngo kibere ishamvu imiryango y’Abisirayeli ukw ar’ icumi n’ibiri: Yosefu azotwara imigabane ibiri. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.47.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.47.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 47:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "GEN.12.7"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Ita 12:7",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "NUM.34.2"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Guh 34:2",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kandi namwe muzocegukira, umuntu wese aringanire n’uwundi; ari co gihugu namanitse ukuboko ndahira ba sogokuruza ko nzokibaha; ico gihugu nyene muzocegukira kibabere ishamvu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.47.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.47.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 47:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "NUM.34.3+NUM.34.4+NUM.34.5+NUM.34.6+NUM.34.7+NUM.34.8+NUM.34.9+NUM.34.10+NUM.34.11+NUM.34.12"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Guh 34:3-12",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nuk’ uru ni rwo ruzoba urugabano rw’igihugu: urubibe rw’i burārūko n’uguhēra ku kiyaga kinini, ugaca i Hetiloni, ugashitsa ahafata i Zedadi, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.47.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.47.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 47:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "n’i Hamati, n’i Berota, n’i Siburayimu ho hagati y’urugabano rw’i Damasiko n’urugabano rw’i Hamati, n’i Hazeri‐hatikoni hahera ku rugabano rw’i Hawurani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.47.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.47.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 47:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nuko rer’ urugabano ruzovuduka ku kiyaga ruce i Hazari‐Enoni ho ku rugabano rw’i Damasiko, ruce ahahera i burārūko h’urugabano rw’ i Hamati. Urwo ni rwo rubibe rw’i burārūko. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.47.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.47.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 47:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Urubibe rw’i burasirazuba ruzoba Yorodani, hagati y’i Hawurani n’i Damasiko n’i Gileyadi n’igihugu c’i Bgisirayeli; muze mugere muhereye ku rugabano rw’i burārūko mushitse ku kiyaga c’i burasirazuba. Urwo ni rwo rubibe rw’i burasirazuba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.47.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.47.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 47:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Urubibe rw’i bumanuko ruzojana i bumanuko nyene, ruvudutse i Tamari ugashitsa ku mazi y’i Meribati‐kadeshi, ugashitsa no ku ruzi rwa Egiputa, ugashitsa no ku kiyaga kinini. Urwo ni rwo rubibe rw’i bumanuko rujana i bumanuko. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.47.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.47.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 47:20"
