          "text": "Kandi muze mukigaburishe ubupfindo ngo kibabere ishamvu, mwebge n’abanyamahanga baba muri mwebge, bakavyarira abana muri mwebge; muze mubaharūre nk’aho bavyawe n’Abisirayeli; bazotwara ishamvu hamwe namwe mu miryango y’Abisirayeli. ",
